				3
			],
			"Message": "docs(Rest): Update domain references from land.playform.cloud to editor.land\n\nReplace all occurrences of the legacy land.playform.cloud and PlayForm.Cloud domains with editor.land across the Rest crate. This includes the GitHub update timestamp, README.md badge URLs, documentation links, footer links, maintainer email, and the CLI author metadata in the command-line help text.\n\nThe editor.land domain is now the canonical endpoint for the Land editor project, superseding the previous land.playform.cloud domain which is in grace-period hold. All documentation, asset URLs, and contact references are aligned to the new domain.",
			"SHA": "633b6e608f654f6b728c33cf75d9fdfa3a506071"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-10T00:17:00Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				102,
				3
			],
			"Message": "style(Rest): Compact launcher and test whitespace formatting\n\nRemove inter-statement blank lines from the Rest launcher (bin/Rest.js) and the OXC compiler unit tests (tests/unit/oxc_compiler.rs). The launcher now groups imports, platform detection, binary resolution, existence check, and execution without separating blank lines. Test functions collapse setup, config construction, and assertions into tighter blocks.\n\nThis reverses the whitespace expansion in 0179d109 and aligns with a more compact visual density across the crate. No functional changes; binary resolution, error reporting, process exit behavior, and all test assertions are preserved.",
			"SHA": "f7478ba44fd30bb31aafe71a5d74e785508db522"
		},
